      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## 08-15-03 automate donor thank you letters and receipts\n\n### How it works\n\n1. A new donation row in the Donations sheet starts the workflow. You can export donations from Stripe, PayPal, GiveButter or GoFundMe into this sheet, or add them manually.\n2. The workflow validates the row, then an AI agent checks the Donor History sheet and writes a warm personalized thank you with a donation receipt.\n3. The thank you is logged to the Thank You Log sheet and emailed to the donor.\n4. Major donors trigger a Telegram alert and an email to the executive director for a personal call.\n5. Every Monday a weekly digest with donation stats and AI highlights is emailed and posted to Telegram.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets (trigger OAuth2), OpenAI, Gmail and Telegram credentials.\n- Create a spreadsheet with three tabs: Donations, DonorHistory and ThankYouLog.\n- Add your donors with their giving history to the DonorHistory tab.\n- New donation rows in the Donations tab start a thank you automatically.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change the major donor threshold, the email templates, or the weekly schedule to match your process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
